      <strong>Action:</strong> Front-load senior hiring in AI Research, ML Engineering, Cybersecurity, and DevOps through 2030. The combination of highest survival rates and an accelerating risk environment means competition for these profiles will intensify. Build internal talent pipelines via accelerated mid-to-senior promotion tracks in these disciplines.</p>
